 "main": {
  "text": "Bike repairs and servicing in Riverside\n\nBring your bike to our workshop on Mill Lane and we will tell you what it needs before we start. Most punctures are fixed while you wait. A full service takes one working day.\n\nBook a repair or call in without an appointment.\n\nWhat does a service include?\nGears and brakes adjusted\nChain cleaned and lubricated\nWheels checked and trued\nSafety check of frame, bolts and tyres\nPrices\nRepair\tPrice\nPuncture repair\t£12\nFull service\t£45\nE-bike check\t£55\nParts\n\nParts are charged separately. We use parts from well-known brands and always show you the old part we replaced.\n\nQuestions\nHow long does a repair take?\n\nPunctures take about twenty minutes. Brake and gear repairs are usually ready the same day.\n\nDo you repair e-bikes?\n\nYes. Our mechanics are trained for the motors and batteries of the common e-bike systems.\n\nRead more",
  "lang": "en-GB"
 },
