   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!-- Fictional demo page for Needle's preview and store screenshots. Riverside Bikes does not exist. -->\n<html lang=\"en-GB\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Bike Repairs and Servicing in Riverside | Same-Day Fixes | Riverside Bikes Workshop</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Book a bike service or repair at Riverside Bikes. Puncture repairs while you wait, full services from £45 and e-bike checks by trained mechanics.\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/repairs/\">\n  <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en-GB\" href=\"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/repairs/\">\n  <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"nl-BE\" href=\"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/nl/herstellingen/\">\n  <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/repairs/\">\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Bike repairs and servicing in Riverside\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Puncture repairs while you wait and full services by trained mechanics.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/img/workshop-og.jpg\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [\n    {\"@type\": \"BikeStore\", \"name\": \"Riverside Bikes\", \"url\": \"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/\",\n     \"logo\": \"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/img/logo.png\",\n     \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"12 Mill Lane\", \"addressLocality\": \"Riverside\", \"addressCountry\": \"GB\"},\n     \"sameAs\": [\"https://www.instagram.com/riversidebikes.example\"]},\n    {\"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [\n      {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/\"},\n      {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Repairs\"}]},\n    {\"@type\": \"Service\", \"name\": \"Bike repairs and servicing\", \"provider\": {\"@id\": \"https://www.riverside-bikes.example/#store\"}}\n  ]}\n  </script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/img/logo.svg\" alt=\"Riverside Bikes\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\"></a>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Main\">\n      <a href=\"/bikes/\">Bikes</a>\n      <a href=\"/repairs/\">Repairs</a>\n      <a href=\"/e-bikes/\">E-bikes</a>\n      <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a>\n      <a href=\"/nl/herstellingen/\" hreflang=\"nl-BE\">Nederlands</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n  <nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> › <span>Repairs</span></nav>\n  <main>\n    <h1>Bike repairs and servicing in Riverside</h1>\n    <img src=\"/img/workshop-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Mechanic truing a wheel in the Riverside Bikes workshop\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" data-test-rect=\"0,180,375,211\">\n    <p>Bring your bike to our workshop on Mill Lane and we will tell you what it needs before we start. Most punctures are fixed while you wait. A full service takes one working day.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"/book/\">Book a repair</a> or call in without an appointment.</p>\n    <h2>What does a service include?</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Gears and brakes adjusted</li>\n      <li>Chain cleaned and lubricated</li>\n      <li>Wheels checked and trued</li>\n      <li>Safety check of frame, bolts and tyres</li>\n    </ul>\n    <img src=\"/img/IMG_4821.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" data-test-rect=\"0,900,375,250\">\n    <h2>Prices</h2>\n    <table>\n      <tr><th>Repair</th><th>Price</th></tr>\n      <tr><td>Puncture repair</td><td>£12</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Full service</td><td>£45</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>E-bike check</td><td>£55</td></tr>\n    </table>\n    <h4>Parts</h4>\n    <p>Parts are charged separately. We use parts from <a href=\"https://www.example.org/brands\">well-known brands</a> and always show you the old part we replaced.</p>\n    <h2>Questions</h2>\n    <h3>How long does a repair take?</h3>\n    <p>Punctures take about twenty minutes. Brake and gear repairs are usually ready the same day.</p>\n    <h3>Do you repair e-bikes?</h3>\n    <p>Yes. Our mechanics are trained for the motors and batteries of the common e-bike systems.</p>\n    <a href=\"\">Read more</a>\n  </main>\n  <footer>\n    <a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy</a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/riversidebikes.example\" rel=\"nofollow\">Instagram</a>\n    <a href=\"tel:+440000000000\">Call us</a>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
  },
